#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:2
msgid "About Read the Docs"
msgstr "关于 Read the Docs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:4
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Read the Docs is a C Corporation registered in Oregon. Our bootstrapped "
"company is owned and fully controlled by the founders, and fully funded by "
"our customers and advertisers. This allows us to **focus 100% on our "
"users**."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 是在俄勒冈州注册的 C "
"Corporation（股份有限公司）。我们这家自举公司由创始人拥有并完全控制，资金完全来自客户和广告商。这使我们能**100% 专注于用户** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:9
msgid "We have two main sources of revenue:"
msgstr "我们有两大主要收入来源："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"|com_brand| - where we `provide <https://app.readthedocs.com>`__ a valuable "
"paid service to companies."
msgstr "|com_brand| ——我们 `向企业提供 <https://app.readthedocs.com>`__ 有价值的付费服务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"|org_brand| - where we provide a free service to the open source community, "
"funded via :doc:`/advertising/ethical-advertising`."
msgstr "|org_brand| ——我们为开源社区提供免费服务，资金来自 :doc:`/advertising/ethical-advertising` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"We believe that having both paying customers and ethical advertising is the "
"best way to create a sustainable platform for our users. We have built "
"something that we expect to last a long time, and we are able to make "
"decisions based only on the best interest of our community and customers."
msgstr "我们认为，同时拥有付费客户和道德广告是为用户创建可持续平台的最佳方式。我们构建的东西经得起长久考验，且我们能仅基于社区和客户的最大利益做决策。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"All of the source code for Read the Docs is open source. You are welcome to "
":doc:`contribute <rtd-dev:contribute>` the features you want or run your own"
" instance. We should note that we generally only support our hosted versions"
" as a matter of :doc:`our philosophy </open-source-philosophy>`."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 的所有源代码均为开源。欢迎你 :doc:`贡献 <rtd-dev:contribute>` "
"你想要的功能，或运行自己的实例。需注意，我们通常仅支持我们托管的版本，这是基于 :doc:`我们的理念 </open-source-"
"philosophy>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"We owe a great deal to the open source community that we are a part of, so "
"we provide free ads via our :ref:`community ads <advertising/ethical-"
"advertising:Community Ads>` program. This allows us to give back to the "
"communities and projects that we support and depend on."
msgstr ""
"我们深受所在开源社区之恩，因此通过 :ref:`社区广告 <advertising/ethical-advertising:Community "
"Ads>` 计划提供免费广告。这让我们能回馈我们所支持和依赖的社区与项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:26
msgid ""
"We are proud about the way we manage our company and products, and are glad "
"to have you on board with us in this :doc:`great documentation journey "
"</story>`."
msgstr "我们为管理公司和产品的方式感到自豪，也很高兴你加入我们这场 :doc:`精彩的文档之旅 </story>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/about/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"If you want to dive more into more specific information and our policies, "
"we've brought most of the most important ones below."
msgstr "如果你想深入了解更具体的信息和我们的政策，我们将最重要的几项列在下方。"

